<?php $presence=visitor_presence_public();?>
<main class="write-main"><h1>Footer visitor statistics</h1><?php foreach(flashes()as$f):?><p class="notice" role="status"><?=e($f['message'])?></p><?php endforeach;?><?php if($error):?><p class="notice error" role="alert"><?=e($error)?></p><?php endif;?>
<section class="settings-card"><h2>Now · current month · current year</h2><p>Period-data status: <?=e($statistics['status']??'Not refreshed')?>. <a href="<?=url('/write/google#diagnostics')?>">Google diagnostics</a></p><p><strong>Now: <?=isset($presence['now'])?number_format($presence['now']):'Not confirmed'?></strong>. Visible public pages send a same-origin, session-bound heartbeat every 20 seconds only after Analytics consent. Multiple tabs count once per browser. Closing or hiding the last tab removes its presence; lost connections expire after 60 seconds. This direct website measurement does not depend on Google’s realtime-report response.</p><p>No page URL, IP address, account name or raw session identifier is stored by the live-presence counter. Only keyed hashes and short-lived tab timestamps are kept encrypted. Analytics consent can be withdrawn through Cookie preferences. Private workspace pages do not send presence.</p><p>Month and year are independent GA4 totalUsers reports, refreshed every five minutes. Google’s processing latency still applies. The year is never the sum of monthly unique counts. Period boundaries and labels follow the verified property time zone; the browser refreshes the display every 20 seconds.</p><p>Wrong-period, thresholded, missing and expired data is withheld. Public polling exposes only aggregate numbers and never triggers Google API requests.</p><form method="post"><?=csrf_field()?><button class="wbtn primary">Refresh verified period statistics</button></form>
<table><thead><tr><th>Counter</th><th>Verified value</th><th>Last query</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach(['monthly_visitors'=>['Current month','month_at','month_status'],'yearly_visitors'=>['Current year','year_at','year_status']]as$key=>[$label,$stamp,$status]):?><tr><td><?=e($label)?></td><td><?=isset($statistics[$key])?number_format($statistics[$key]):'Not confirmed'?></td><td><?=!empty($statistics[$stamp])?e(date('j M Y H:i:s',$statistics[$stamp])):'Not queried'?></td><td><?=e($statistics[$status]??'Pending')?></td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table><p>Time zone: <?=e($statistics['timezone']??'Not verified')?> · Month: <?=e($statistics['month']??'Not queried')?> · Year: <?=e($statistics['year']??'Not queried')?></p>
</section></main>
